## Other gaps worth flagging

- **No `index.ts` barrel** anywhere in `ui-kits/` — every consumer deep-imports `app/components/ui-kits/<layer>/<name>`.
- **Inconsistent export style:** `ZimmColourSwatch`, `ZimmSizeChip`, `ZimmColourSwatchGroup`, `ZimmSizeChipGroup`, `ZimmSlideIndicator`, `ZimmProductCardContent`, `ZimmProductCardMedia`, `ZimmProductCard` have `export default`; the other 25 are named-only.
- **Inconsistent props-type export:** only `ZimmColourSwatchProps`, `ZimmSizeChipProps`, `ZimmLinkProps`, `ZimmProductCardContentProps`, `ZimmProductCardMediaProps`, and the `ZimmProductCard*` family are exported. The ★ priority components' props types (`ZimmTextInputProps`, `ZimmButtonProps`, `ZimmDropdownProps`, `ZimmDropdownItemProps`, `ZimmModalProps`, `ZimmDrawerProps`, `ZimmSearchInputProps`, `ZimmInputActionProps`, `ZimmTabsProps`) are all **module-private**.
- **Missing `index.test.tsx`:** `zimmDrawer`, `zimmIcon`, `zimmLogo`, `zimmModal`, `zimmSearchInput`, `zimmTextInput`, `zimmContactIconRow`, `zimmInputAction`, `zimmProductContent`, `zimmPdpDrawer`, `zimmSubscribeModal` (11 of 33). `zimmTextInput` and `zimmSizeChip`/`zimmSizeChipGroup`/`zimmSlideIndicator` have `*.css.test.ts` recipe tests instead/as well.
- **No recipe file:** `zimmIcon`, `zimmLogo`, `zimmInputAction`.
- **Hardcoded English strings** in `zimmInputAction/index.tsx` (`'Please enter a value.'`, `'Please enter a valid email address.'`, `buttonLabel = 'Submit'`) and `zimmSubscribeModal/index.tsx` (`'First Name'`, `'Last Name'`, `'Cancel'`, `'Continue'`, `PRIVACY_CONSENT_COPY`), and in `zimmTabs/index.tsx` (`'Previous tab'`, `'Next tab'`) and `zimmDrawer/index.tsx` (`label="Close"`) — while most other components use `react-intl` or `useUiCopy`.
